  "royal-empire": {
    "title": "Royal empire",
    "subtitle": "Branding &amp; Advertisement",
    "description": "Royal Empire, a key player in Indian real estate, is venturing into a $30 million opulent residential project in Maharashtra, India. Recognizing that 30% of units are typically sold pre-construction, the significance of branding in building trust with potential buyers cannot be overstated.Thinkin\u2019 Birds partnered with Royal Empire to create a distinctive brand identity for the project, positioning it as a luxurious haven for the city's elite. This collaboration extended to the development of a sophisticated website aimed at driving lead generation through targeted digital marketing. With substantial investments in premium amenities and world-class facilities, the goal is to convey a sense of opulence and unparalleled luxury for those choosing to make this remarkable building their home.",
